Package: retiaudit
Title: Inspect Python Selection Hints Without Starting Python
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daiki", "Kumakura", email = "55353329+DaikiKumakura@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A read-only preflight for Python environment selection with
    reticulate. Identifies explicit overrides, project-local environment hints,
    and conflicts with a requested managed environment. Produces a report
    that omits local paths and environment values. Does not initialize Python,
    discover interpreters, install software, or modify configuration.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: reticulate (>= 1.41.0), testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/retiaudit
BugReports: https://github.com/DaikiKumakura/retiaudit/issues
